scopeTest is test
scopeTest purpose "A library's scope falls back to the runtime's C library only when it needs it, for bind; a name no file has opens nothing"
scopeTest verifies symbolOf findsInScope
scopeTest verifies openLibrary opensOrRefuses
scopeTest typeParameter none
scopeTest input none
scopeTest output none
scopeTest outputOwnedBy none
scopeTest raises none
scopeTest effect use machine.memory
